This repository and the container images built from it are a MODIFIED version
of OpenMES ("OpenMES PA"), maintained for production automation at edeseczka.

Upstream
--------
OpenMES v0.28.0, upstream commit eb184a2984b74d685e65ee24df9b8c7b34c765f6
(https://github.com/Mes-Open/OpenMes).

Modifications
-------------
- PA change set R05–R22 applied to the backend (see PA-BASELINE.md for the
  mapping of each change to files).
- PA modules PipelineDashboard and PlPackagingExtras under backend/modules/.
- Image/deployment and licensing hardening (digest-pinned images, AGPL notice
